ar/level:\n\n4a. Gloves:\n\n4b. Respirators:\n\n4c. Clothing:\n\n4d. Boots:\n\n4e. Chemical cartridge change frequency:\n\n5. Decon\n\n5a. Instructions:\n\n5b. Decon equipment and materials:\n\n# ICS 201-5 - Site Safety and Control Analysis\n\nINCIDENT ACTION PLAN SOFTWARE™\n\nYes Yes\n\nAreaRays (6), Particulate monitors, Gastec pumps (4), Benzene (2),\n\nSKC pumps (10)\n\nHot zone & boundaries continual\n\nN/A\n\nyes if job requires\n\nNone required\n\nFR, Bunker\n\nSteel Toe\n\nNone at this time\n\nYes Yes\n\nUpdated 04/28/2024 11:03 MDT UTC-6\n\nPrinted 04/29/2024 08:54 MDT UTC-6\n\n15 of 35\n\n© TRG", "width": 1825, "height": 1409, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "ICS 201-5 - Site Safety and Control Analysis", "bbox": {"x": 37.98960433181399, "y": 783.6190989063775, "width": 35.31610279604553, "height": 593.1988145828248}}, {"kind": "list", "text": "2. Warning sign(s), barriers, color codes in place? Hazardous material being monitored?", "bbox": {"x": 1047.4678098254387, "y": 783.7562465312286, "width": 67.48397879278545, "height": 592.9541666666665}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Incident Name: MP180 Gallup Sub Derailment", "bbox": {"x": 88.02248553105034, "y": 883.5604125570834, "width": 26.406797182138337, "height": 493.15}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Version Name: 04/28/2024 10:49:24", "bbox": {"x": 41.07715071352188, "y": 26.418746183958394, "width": 23.472705186371627, "height": 381.6041666666666}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Period: Initial Response [04/26/2024 13:44 - 04/28/2024 07:00]", "bbox": {"x": 88.02247163316213, "y": 26.418743395312642, "width": 26.40681676925952, "height": 660.46875}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Site Control", "bbox": {"x": 132.03375628551248, "y": 628.1791652576668, "width": 23.472680002930087, "height": 140.89999999999998}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Yes", "bbox": {"x": 170.17684595069147, "y": 651.6624996854912, "width": 23.472674406609734, "height": 44.03125}}, {"kind": "list", "text": "Emergency escape route established?